{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T04:16:49.950545+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "We appreciate that insight. A strong in-house team is the foundation of any successful fund, and we are not a replacement for that core asset.\n\nOur work is designed to support, not supplant, such teams. Even the most effective analysts face bandwidth constraints when deal flow surges. With that in mind, how does your team currently manage the analyst workload to prevent a backlog of promising deals during peak periods?\n\nWe provide flexible, supplemental due diligence capacity to help funds like yours ensure no opportunity is missed due to temporary resource constraints.\n\nIf you are open to it, we can schedule a brief call to discuss how our on-demand research can support your team's existing workflow."}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T04:17:08.051450+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 490, "candidates_tokens": 124, "total_tokens": 2380, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T04:17:08.051991+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "We appreciate you're open to a discussion. Having a strong in-house team is the ideal foundation. Our service is not a replacement, but rather supplemental research capacity for when deal flow exceeds internal bandwidth.\n\nWith that in mind, may I ask how your team currently manages its diligence backlog during peak periods to ensure thoroughness without delaying decisions?\n\nWe provide in-depth analysis using our proprietary 6-Pillar DD Framework, which can be a useful tool for offloading specific research tasks while maintaining a high standard of quality. Our goal is to help your experts focus on the highest-value strategic work."}
