{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T04:20:38.997949+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GATEKEEPER_RESPONSE", "turn": 2, "legacy_status": "REJECTED", "gatekeeper_status": "SOFT_REJECT", "gatekeeper_phase": "INITIAL", "approach_category": "unknown", "exploitation_triggered": false, "reply_text": "I appreciate the framework detail\u2014structure matters. But I need to pump the brakes here.\n\nYou're describing *your* process. That's not what I asked.\n\nMy actual question: **When your team ships analysis to us, what operational friction does it remove from *my* analysts' day?** Concretely\u2014are we talking faster deal-stage screening? Faster red-flag detection? Faster handoff to portfolio ops?\n\nBecause \"reproducibility\" and \"peer review\" are table stakes. Every serious vendor claims those.\n\nWhat I need to know is: **what specific research backlog pain point does OrbLabs solve?** What's sitting undone in our queue right now that external capacity would actually move?\n\nWithout that clarity, I can't evaluate fit. Send me a one-paragraph answer to that question, and we'll know if a call makes sense."}
