{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T04:21:22.749302+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "A fair challenge. The specific pain point we remove is the time-consuming, top-of-funnel screening of inbound deals. Our service takes on this high-volume, low-yield task, delivering a validated shortlist of opportunities that meet your initial criteria. This frees your expert analysts from preliminary vetting and allows them to concentrate exclusively on the complex, late-stage diligence required for high-conviction investments. The \"undone\" work we move is the mountain of initial-stage deals, ensuring your team's valuable time is spent only on the most promising targets. To that end, is the initial qualification of new deals currently the primary bottleneck in your diligence pipeline?"}
