{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T04:21:42.629155+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "To be direct, OrbLabs solves the specific pain point of the top-of-funnel deal screening backlog. Our service absorbs the high-volume, repetitive diligence required to qualify inbound crypto opportunities: initial tokenomics modeling, smart contract red flag analysis, team verification, and preliminary competitive landscape mapping. This clears the screening queue that consumes your analysts' time, freeing them from the operational drag of sifting through raw deal flow. Instead of performing initial QA, your team receives a validated, prioritized short-list, allowing them to dedicate their core hours exclusively to deep, late-stage diligence on pre-vetted assets. Given this focus on clearing the initial funnel, is the primary bottleneck for your team currently this top-of-funnel screening volume, or does the backlog pressure build up more during the deeper, quantitative modeling phase of diligence?"}
